    description: Certification for Schedules A, B and C. Enter the date you signed
      certifying all statements made on these schedules are true to the best of your
      knowledge and belief. Enter a two digit month and day and a four digit year.
    x_petey_description_source: tooltip
    label_source: llm
    x_petey_adjudication:
      verdict: proposed
      proposed: schedules_certification_signature_dt
      reason: The caption directly above the box reads 'Date (mm/dd/yyyy)' in the
        Applicant's Certification section, confirming this is the certification date;
        'schedules_certification_signature_dt' describes this better than the generic
        '_2' suffix of the current name.
      model: claude-sonnet-4-6
      contested: a witness says this widget's text belongs to another field
    x_petey_review:
      model: claude-opus-5
      changed:
      - name
      reason: The bare '_2' suffix does not distinguish this box from applicant_signature_dt;
        the tooltip identifies it as the certification date for Schedules A, B and
        C.
      before:
        type: date
        semantic_type: iso_date
        description: Certification for Schedules A, B and C. Enter the date you signed
          certifying all statements made on these schedules are true to the best of
          your knowledge and belief. Enter a two digit month and day and a four digit
          year.
      old_name: applicant_signature_dt_2
      adjudicated: proposed
      judged: 'kept: 0 -> 0'
